#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:12
msgid "Tune Kamino"
msgstr "Kamino 调优"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:14
msgid ""
"Kamino is a beta Newton solver selected through a task-exposed "
"``newton_kamino`` preset. This guide isolates and measures a reproducible "
"problem before changing its solver settings. The generated API documentation"
" for :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoPADMMSolverCfg` and "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoDVISolverCfg` remains authoritative "
"for current fields and defaults."
msgstr ""
"Kamino 是处于测试阶段的 Newton 求解器，通过任务提供的 ``newton_kamino`` "
"预设启用。本指南先定位并测量可复现的问题，再调整求解器设置。各配置字段及其当前默认值，以 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoPADMMSolverCfg` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoDVISolverCfg` 的自动生成 API 文档为准。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:22
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:24
msgid ""
"Read :ref:`backends-and-presets` for preset semantics and :ref:`hydra-"
"backend-solver-presets` for task integration. Prepare the asset for Newton "
"with :doc:`/source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton`. Confirm that the task "
"exposes ``newton_kamino`` through its ``--help`` output or the "
":doc:`environment catalog </source/setup/environments>`; do not infer Kamino"
" support from another Newton preset."
msgstr ""
"预设的含义见 :ref:`backends-and-presets` ，任务中的集成方式见 :ref:`hydra-backend-solver-"
"presets` 。请按照 :doc:`/source/how-to/prepare_asset_for_newton` 为 Newton "
"准备资产。通过任务的 ``--help`` 输出或 :doc:`环境目录 </source/setup/environments>` 确认任务是否提供 "
"``newton_kamino`` ；不能因为任务支持其他 Newton 预设，就推断它也支持 Kamino。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:32
msgid "Start from an explicit baseline"
msgstr "建立明确的基准配置"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:34
msgid "Run one small visual smoke test before training or benchmarking:"
msgstr "训练或性能测试前，先运行一个小规模的可视化冒烟测试："

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:40
msgid ""
"Then fix the initial state, seed, action sequence, and reset distribution. "
"For that reproduction, record penetration, slip, energy, a task metric, a "
"convergence diagnostic, and runtime. Change one decision at a time so every "
"candidate can be compared with the same baseline."
msgstr ""
"然后固定初始状态、随机种子、动作序列和重置状态分布。记录这一复现场景中的穿透、滑移、能量、任务指标、收敛诊断结果和运行耗时。每次只调整一项，以便在同一基准下比较所有候选配置。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:46
msgid "Choose PADMM or DVI"
msgstr "选择 PADMM 或 DVI"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:48
msgid ""
"Choose PADMM first for contact-heavy tasks. DVI is a candidate for "
"mechanisms with relatively few active contacts. If a DVI task needs an "
"explicit :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoDynamicsCfg` override, "
"disable preconditioning; otherwise leave the dynamics override unset so "
"Newton selects the compatible defaults."
msgstr ""
"接触密集的任务优先选择 PADMM；活动接触较少的机构可以考虑 DVI。如果 DVI 任务需要显式覆盖 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoDynamicsCfg` "
"，应禁用预条件处理；否则不要设置动力学覆盖配置，让 Newton 选择兼容的默认值。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:55
msgid "Validate reset and state consistency"
msgstr "验证重置与状态一致性"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:57
msgid ""
"Validate root and joint state writes through the Isaac Lab asset APIs before"
" tuning the solver. Kamino's maximal-coordinate body poses must agree with "
"the reduced joint state after every reset. Investigate body-pose and joint-"
"state disagreement, including custom reset code and reset overlaps, before "
"changing convergence or stabilization settings."
msgstr ""
"调优求解器前，先验证通过 Isaac Lab 资产 API 写入的根状态和关节状态。每次重置后，Kamino "
"的最大坐标刚体位姿都必须与约化关节状态一致。如果刚体位姿与关节状态不一致，应先检查自定义重置代码、重置时的物体重叠等问题，再调整收敛或稳定化设置。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:64
msgid "Choose and size collision handling"
msgstr "选择碰撞处理方式并确定容量"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:66
msgid ""
"Compare Kamino's internal detector with Newton's collision pipeline using "
"the same full reset and contact distribution. ``use_collision_detector`` on "
"the Kamino solver selects the internal path, which "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoCollisionDetectorCfg` configures; "
"when it is disabled, "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCollisionPipelineCfg` configures "
"Newton's path. Size the active path only from observed capacity failures, "
"missing contacts, or warnings, and use those generated APIs for the exact "
"controls. Collision capacity cannot correct invalid geometry or reset "
"penetration."
msgstr ""
"在相同的完整重置分布和接触分布下，比较 Kamino 内置检测器与 Newton 碰撞管线。Kamino 求解器上的 "
"``use_collision_detector`` 用于选择内置路径，其参数由 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoCollisionDetectorCfg` 配置；禁用内置路径时，由 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCollisionPipelineCfg` 配置 Newton "
"路径。仅在观察到容量不足、接触丢失或警告时调整当前路径的容量，具体控制项以这些自动生成的 API 文档为准。增加碰撞容量无法修复无效几何或重置时的穿透。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:77
msgid "Tune timestep and substeps"
msgstr "调整时间步长与子步数"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:79
msgid ""
"Hold the policy period and fixed reproduction constant. Only after the model"
" and reset are valid, compare a smaller simulation timestep or more "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg.num_substeps` for the same policy "
"period. Recheck the recorded physical, convergence, task, and runtime "
"metrics; do not change policy timing merely to hide an unstable simulation "
"step."
msgstr ""
"保持策略周期和固定的复现场景不变。只有在模型与重置均已验证后，才比较同一策略周期下更小的仿真时间步长或更多的 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg.num_substeps` "
"。重新检查已记录的物理、收敛、任务和耗时指标；不要仅为掩盖仿真步的不稳定而改变策略时序。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:86
msgid "Tune convergence and stabilization"
msgstr "调整收敛与稳定化参数"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:88
msgid ""
"Tune :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoPADMMCfg` iteration and residual"
" controls only for a reproducible PADMM convergence failure. For DVI, tune "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoDVICfg` alternating iterations and "
"tolerance only for the same kind of evidence. Change "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoConstraintsCfg` stabilization "
"controls only after collision and reset validation. More solver work cannot "
"repair inconsistent state, invalid collision geometry, or reset overlap."
msgstr ""
"仅当 PADMM 的收敛失败可复现时，才调整 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoPADMMCfg` "
"的迭代与残差控制项。对于 DVI，也应有同类证据后再调整 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoDVICfg` "
"的交替迭代次数和容差。只有验证碰撞与重置后，才调整 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoConstraintsCfg` "
"的稳定化控制项。增加求解计算量无法修复状态不一致、无效碰撞几何或重置时的重叠。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:97
msgid "Optimize only after validation"
msgstr "验证后再优化性能"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:99
msgid ""
"Disable diagnostics before performance measurements. Retain only changes "
"that improve the recorded metrics, and separately measure sparse Jacobian, "
"CUDA graph, collision, substep, and iteration costs when each applies to the"
" selected solver and workload. For the parallel workflow, see "
":doc:`solver_tuning_mjwarp`; it does not replace Kamino-specific validation "
"or tuning."
msgstr ""
"测量性能前关闭诊断。只保留能改善已记录指标的修改，并根据所选求解器和负载，分别测量稀疏雅可比、CUDA 图、碰撞、子步和迭代的开销。对应的 MJWarp"
" 流程见 :doc:`solver_tuning_mjwarp` ，但它不能替代 Kamino 自身的验证和调优。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino.rst:105
msgid ""
"The diagnose-first order is: validate the baseline, reset state, and "
"collision path; compare timestep and substeps; investigate convergence and "
"stabilization; then optimize measured costs."
msgstr "先诊断、后调优的顺序是：验证基准、重置状态与碰撞路径；比较时间步长和子步数；排查收敛与稳定化问题；最后优化实测开销。"
